# Emergent Matrix — env template (copy to .env.local; never commit real keys)
# All keys are OPTIONAL — app works keyless, keys just raise rate limits / enrich data.

# CoinGecko Demo API — free at https://www.coingecko.com/en/api
# Get a Demo key → paste here. Server proxy uses header x-cg-demo-api-key.
# Without it: 10-30 req/min. With Demo key: 30-50 req/min. Pro key: x-cg-pro-api-key.
COINGECKO_API_KEY=[REDACTED]

# Helius — Solana DAS/RPC (free tier at https://www.helius.dev)
# Used via /api/helius proxy (never exposed to client)
HELIUS_API_KEY=[REDACTED]

# DexScreener — 100% FREE, NO KEY NEEDED
# Docs: https://docs.dexscreener.com/api/reference
# Endpoints (keyless, CORS *):
#   https://api.dexscreener.com/latest/dex/search/?q=TOKEN
#   https://api.dexscreener.com/latest/dex/tokens/{tokenAddress}
#   https://api.dexscreener.com/latest/dex/pairs/{chainId}/{pairId}
#   https://api.dexscreener.com/token-boosts/latest/v1
#   https://api.dexscreener.com/token-boosts/top/v1
# Proxied at /api/dex?q=...&address=...&kind=boosts (no key required)

# OpenSea — OPTIONAL, for trending NFT collections
# Get key at https://docs.opensea.io/reference/api-keys
# Without it: app falls back to CoinGecko NFTs + DexScreener boosts (free, no key, still rich)
# OPENSEA_API_KEY=[REDACTED]

# Etherscan V2 — OPTIONAL, for ETH token enrichment
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ETHERSCAN_API_KEY=[REDACTED]

# NVIDIA NIM — FREE AI inference (Kimi K3, DeepSeek V4, 80+ models)
# Free key at https://build.nvidia.com (Generate API Key)
# Used server-side only via /api/ai (POST { prompt }) — never exposed to client
# NVAPI_KEY=[REDACTED]

# Privy — OPTIONAL, for wallet+X login
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PRIVY_APP_ID=[REDACTED]
